24
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,370
Master,

25
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,970
since someone is ahead of us,

26
00:01:56,720 --> 00:01:58,610
let's just follow them !

27
00:01:58,600 --> 00:02:00,290
It'll save us some effort.

28
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,370
It's too quiet.

29
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,410
Hurry up, Master.

30
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:19,250
They paved a way for us,

31
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,570
it's a great opportunity.

32
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,850
As expected,

33
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:34,090
the restriction still exists.

34
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,010
What are you doing !?

35
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:39,970
You wouldn't...

36
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:52,890
We have no choice but to fight.

37
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:55,410
Underlings, attack them !

38
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:06,490
No way...

39
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:19,410
Master... Master...

40
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:22,370
This thing is too powerful,

41
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:24,370
I've done my best...

42
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:37,690
If I try to use brute force with my Core Formation cultivation,

43
00:03:38,520 --> 00:03:40,090
I'll die for sure.

44
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,090
Master,

45
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,570
how do we break this thing ?

46
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:47,410
I don't know.

47
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:49,890
What's so great about you ?

48
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,850
"I don't know"

49
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:54,410
All restrictions must have a core.

50
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:57,890
If there's a core, it can be broken.

51
00:03:58,480 --> 00:04:00,570
This restriction is extremely complex,

52
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:02,290
it was clearly set up by an expert.

53
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:04,610
I can only try to unravel it bit by bit.

54
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:11,290
Why are we studying now ?

55
00:04:31,320 --> 00:04:32,850
Master,

56
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:35,810
it's been 10 days... 10 days !

57
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:38,610
What are you doing exactly !?

58
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:41,490
I did it.

59
00:04:44,960 --> 00:04:45,890
Here.

60
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:48,410
This is the core of the restriction.

61
00:04:48,800 --> 00:04:49,810
Wait...

62
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:50,690
This is...

63
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,890
fear ?

64
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:54,170
Fear

65
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:57,130
Fear !

66
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:01,330
A fear aura ?

67
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:02,730
Master,

68
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:05,570
the person ahead of us is the Six Desires Devil Lord.

69
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:07,010
Well played...

70
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:10,930
He overlayed a fear aura over the original restriction.

71
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,810
No wonder it was so strong.

72
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:19,210
Using spiritual energy to break restrictions

73
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:20,690
is too slow.

74
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,410
Maybe if I could attack them with Divine Sense...

75
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,330
Master,

76
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:26,210
what should we do now ?

77
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,850
Don't panic,

78
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:29,850
I'm not worried about him being ahead

79
00:05:29,600 --> 00:05:32,170
but of someone catching up from behind.

80
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:32,930
Right !

81
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:36,250
Either that old ghost dies ahead

82
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,610
or clears the path for us.

83
00:05:38,640 --> 00:05:40,770
But since you broke his restriction,

84
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:44,130
won't that old ghost notice

85
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:45,970
that we're following him ?

86
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:49,290
He will definitely notice

87
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:52,450
but he might not guess that it's me.

88
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:07,690
The restriction has been broken.

89
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:11,530
I wonder if it's that old ghost Duanmu or Hunchback Meng.

90
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:13,410
It doesn't matter,

91
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:16,610
I have studied restrictions for 1000 years.

92
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:19,890
I'll properly prepare the road for you.

93
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:30,650
7 years later

94
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:35,010
You damn fiend !

95
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:37,690
He keeps using me to test the restrictions !

96
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,410
I've served you well !

97
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,490
I've shed blood for you !

98
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:42,410
You can't treat me like this !

99
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:47,330
These restriction cores are made with Divine Sense.

100
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:50,450
If only I could use my Divine Sense to destroy them.

101
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,850
Master, what did you do !?

102
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:10,410
Help me !

103
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:14,410
Attacking it with Divine Sense triggers the restriction.

104
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:17,010
What happens if I cover the core

105
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:18,290
with my Divine Sense.

106
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,130
Go !

107
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:54,290
Using Divine Sense to break restrictions

108
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:56,370
is much more effective than spiritual energy.

109
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,290
Master, congratulations

110
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:19,490
on mastering Divine Sense restriction attacks.

111
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:21,650
We'll easily beat this second trial !

112
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:25,210
A few months later

113
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:34,410
My understanding of restrictions has tremendously improved.

114
00:08:34,400 --> 00:08:37,010
Everything the Six Desires Devil Lord can do,

115
00:08:36,760 --> 00:08:39,730
I, Wang Lin, can also do now.

116
00:08:48,960 --> 00:08:51,570
Although the first trial took some time,

117
00:08:51,800 --> 00:08:54,970
I've been able to preserve

118
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,610
most of my artifacts.

119
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:18,690
Evil-Subduing Demonic Fire !

120
00:09:34,840 --> 00:09:38,410
I hate these convoluted restrictions the most.

121
00:09:38,640 --> 00:09:41,650
I already passed this trial 1000 years ago.

122
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:44,810
This second trial won't stop me.

123
00:10:08,800 --> 00:10:10,050
Who is it ?

124
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:11,450
How are they going so fast ?

125
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:13,770
He's using brute force to break the restrictions.

126
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:15,410
It can only be Duanmu Ji.

127
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:17,010
Then aren't we doomed ?

128
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:19,090
We can't go forward nor backwards.

129
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,610
No matter what we do, we're dead !

130
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:23,490
We must delay him as much as possible.

131
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:52,130
A wind and thunder restriction ?

132
00:10:57,040 --> 00:10:58,730
Wraith Lash,

133
00:10:58,480 --> 00:10:59,250
go !

134
00:11:17,160 --> 00:11:18,450
Something's wrong !

135
00:11:29,520 --> 00:11:30,530
I remember that

136
00:11:30,280 --> 00:11:33,290
this wind and thunder restriction didn't have this frost attack before.

137
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:35,690
Someone must have tampered with it.

138
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:55,850
Someone this familiar with restrictions

139
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:58,530
and cunning enough to do this,

140
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:02,450
It must be that Six Desires freak !

141
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:35,410
My artifact !

142
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:17,970
Six Desires brat,

143
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:20,770
this old man won't let you get away with it !

144
00:13:24,040 --> 00:13:25,490
We're doomed...

145
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:27,490
It's the end for us !

146
00:13:27,520 --> 00:13:30,530
That old devil Duanmu Ji is catching up !

147
00:13:43,680 --> 00:13:45,450
Master, what are you doing ?

148
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:47,890
Don't do anything reckless !

149
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:16,890
No matter how powerful you are, you're only at Core Formation.

150
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:20,010
If you touch the restrictions here, you'll die for sure !

151
00:14:20,680 --> 00:14:22,410
Just run away !

152
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:28,570
Since we can't escape,

153
00:14:28,640 --> 00:14:30,410
we might as well hide here.

154
00:14:30,160 --> 00:14:30,970
What ?

155
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,330
Found it !

156
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:44,770
Crossing the restriction while rewriting it

157
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:48,010
is crazy. You're completely crazy !

158
00:15:18,800 --> 00:15:21,530
Master, you scared me to death.

159
00:15:21,720 --> 00:15:24,970
I thought you were done for.

160
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:27,650
Help me,

161
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:29,650
spit out the souls you've refined.

162
00:15:46,560 --> 00:15:50,130
Master, what do you need the souls for ?

163
00:15:50,640 --> 00:15:53,610
The Divine Sense of a Soul Formation is powerful.

164
00:15:53,560 --> 00:15:56,050
By using a large number of souls,

165
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:57,890
I can block it a bit.

166
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:21,050
Even my Divine Sense can't penetrate this fog.

167
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:25,530
What trick is that Six Desires brat up to now ?

168
00:16:45,650 --> 00:19:08,610
There was no sense of time in the mountain, so in the blink of an eye, seven years had passed. On this day, Wang Lin drank some spirit liquid as he stood on a rock on the side of the mountain. In these past seven years, half of Wang Lin’s hair had turned white.
He had devoted himself to studying restrictions, causing him to be mentally stressed all the time. Four years ago, his hair started turning white at the root.
His eyes were even more sharp, and his temperament had changed greatly. If Wang Lin was like never-melting ice seven years ago, then now he was also impossible to see through.

This feeling came from his eyes. His eyes seemed to be able to see everything, and there were stars within them that would sometimes flash. If Duanmu Ji saw Wang Lin now, he probably wouldn’t believe it. These were the divine sense eyes that were only obtained once someone had reached a certain level of mastery in restrictions.
Wang spent these past seven years refining his eyes. In these seven years, he had encountered countless restrictions. All of them required him to carefully study and examine them. He was almost killed by those restrictions many times.

-> The divine sense restriction eyes were not adapted in the donghua. They are represented by the black and white rotating energy Wang Lin casts.

Just from looking at the restrictions, Wang Lin could see that this person’s understanding of restrictions was much deeper than his.

However, Wang Lin wasn’t scared at all. His interest in leaving the second trial had decreased a lot. From his point of view, this was the dreamland for learning restrictions. The way the restrictions became progressively more complex meant that a person could start at the basics and work their way up.

This kind of place was almost impossible to find. The restrictions went from simple to difficult. It was a very valuable place.

169
00:17:14,840 --> 00:17:21,970
Count the specks of time

170
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:21,970
floating down gently.

171
00:17:22,080 --> 00:17:28,210
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

172
00:17:29,080 --> 00:17:35,730
Forever lock away the scars

173
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:35,730
of this mortal life.

174
00:17:35,740 --> 00:17:42,250
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

175
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:49,970
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

176
00:17:45,320 --> 00:17:49,970
that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.

177
00:17:49,800 --> 00:17:57,130
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

178
00:17:51,840 --> 00:17:57,130
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

179
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:59,650
I will ask the heavens who exactly

180
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:04,410
sliced open this world

181
00:18:00,800 --> 00:18:04,410
to let the rain fall in.

182
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:06,410
I will refine the world

183
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:08,930
to make our palm lines say

184
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:11,290
that we will live forever.

185
00:18:11,040 --> 00:18:14,210
Walking off the beaten path

186
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:17,290
through heaven and earth.

187
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:24,250
Before returning to dust,

188
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:24,250
I will refine this mortal body.

189
00:18:25,520 --> 00:18:33,130
The left shore is the joyous laughter

190
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:33,130
that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.

191
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:39,730
The right shore is an eternal silence

192
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:39,730
lingering under the candlelight.

193
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:42,610
To overturn this fate,

194
00:18:42,360 --> 00:18:46,970
I will walk against the heavens.

195
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:54,130
I will even gather the clouds

196
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:54,130
to illuminate the sky for you.

197
00:18:54,280 --> 00:18:58,370
All this sadness was not meaningless.

198
00:18:58,120 --> 00:19:01,690
How many lives and deaths
have passed in the blink of an eye ?

199
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:07,490
I vow to break

200
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:07,490
this chess game of fate.

201
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:18,450
I vow to break

202
00:19:10,360 --> 00:19:18,450
this chess game of fate.
